    reason: ReplacementStaged {
      replacement: "THIS IS NOT COST-DEBT: no identity is withheld from execution, which is the distinction the landing-side chat drew when it refused cost-debt for gunbc#10994's tripwire. 72,300 is not re-derived or raised; floor_cost_debt refuses ceiling tuning by name and the new-witness tier remains operator policy. THE FALSIFIER HAS NOT RUN AS OF THIS DECLARATION: sleek-hawk-250's controlled reading does not exist yet, so the dominance claim below is HYPOTHESISED, not measured. sleek-hawk-250's partition attributes ~69% of the #10994 witness to roadmap_authority_projection; the same per-claim projection is the hypothesised dominant cost of these four; if the controlled reading on witness_dispatch_never_presents_empty_frontier_on_authority_refusal shows the projection does NOT dominate, this trigger is wrong and the row is amended before any citing PR lands again. Restoration is the loaded roadmap history consumed as a prepared effect input so no per-claim projection is paid",
    },
    population: [
      "test.claim.roadmap_authority.witness_projected_dependency_edges_include_active_edges: 318227 eval_steps on run 34854812903; pre-existing unchanged identity first measured under the gunbc#11195 tier, not a regression by any PR",
      "test.claim.roadmap_program_view_live_corpus_receipt.live_roadmap_program_view_corpus_projection_receipt: 226622 eval_steps on run 34854812903; pre-existing unchanged identity first measured under the gunbc#11195 tier, not a regression by any PR",
      "test.claim.roadmap_receipt_continuity_acceptance.witness_dispatch_never_presents_empty_frontier_on_authority_refusal: 441871 eval_steps on run 34854812903; pre-existing unchanged identity first measured under the gunbc#11195 tier, not a regression by any PR",
      "test.claim.roadmap_receipt_continuity_acceptance.witness_missing_carrier_prevents_silent_empty_authority_projection: 370743 eval_steps on run 34854812903; pre-existing unchanged identity first measured under the gunbc#11195 tier, not a regression by any PR",
    ],
    restoration_trigger: "THE CAPABILITY, BOTH CLAUSES, NOT EITHER: (i) loaded roadmap history consumed as a prepared effect input (dashboard work item adhoc-5ecec982-c23; gentle-ram-506's lane) so no per-claim projection is paid; WHAT adhoc-5ecec982-c23 MUST BE SUFFICIENT FOR: a required-floor claim does not re-pay the live roadmap projection per claim because that history is already a prepared effect input. (ii) AND each of the four identities measured under 72,300 eval_steps on the acceptance path, still executing, still recording eval_steps, still blocking on a semantic red. Measuring the four under budget without the prepared-input capability does not retire the row; landing the capability without those four under 72,300 on the acceptance path does not retire it either. 72,300 is not raised to retire this row",
  }
